./ R 00388000          $ 00388010 010                                           
NOTCHG1  CL    R2,=A(X'01000000') M4B.3: FRAME ABOVE 16 MB?    XA0055DK         
         BL    NOTCHG1L                                        XA0055DK         
         OI    RCWFLAG,IDA    YES: THROUGH JIDAL1/JIDAL2       XA0055DK         
         LA    R15,JIDAL1                                      XA0055DK         
         STCM  R15,7,RCWADDR+1                                 XA0055DK         
         ST    R2,JIDAL1                                       XA0055DK         
*  IDAW 2: THIS FRAME'S SECOND HALF, NEVER THE NEXT FRAME      XA0055DK         
*  (DGUNLOK UNLOCKS IT: PTR003). FROM THE SECOND HALF NO       XA0055DK         
*  2 KB BOUNDARY FOLLOWS, SO IDAW 2 IS NOT USED.               XA0055DK         
         LR    R15,R2                                          XA0055DK         
         N     R15,=A(X'7FFFF800')                             XA0055DK         
         LA    R0,2048                                         XA0055DK         
         NR    R0,R15         IN THE SECOND HALF?              XA0055DK         
         BNZ   *+8            YES: THAT HALF                   XA0055DK         
         LA    R15,2048(,R15) NO: THE SECOND HALF              XA0055DK         
         ST    R15,JIDAL2                                      XA0055DK         
         LR    R15,R3         DOES THE AREA CROSS A PAGE?      XA0055DK         
         BCTR  R15,0                                           XA0055DK         
         XR    R15,R1                                          XA0055DK         
         N     R15,=A(X'7FFFF000')                             XA0055DK         
         BNZ   NOTCHG1M       YES: ALTER2 SETS JIDAL2          XA0055DK         
         CALL  DMKPTRLK       NO: DGUNLOK UNLOCKS BOTH IDAWS   XA0055DK         
         B     NOTCHG1M                                        XA0055DK         
NOTCHG1L STCM  R2,7,RCWADDR+1 STORE REAL ADDRESS IN RCWTASK    XA0055DK         
NOTCHG1M DS    0H                                              XA0055DK         
